================================================================
Reproducibility warning (new)
================================================================
Absolute numbers drift between jobs on this box, by up to ~10% at long context.
The same config (p32768 n128 r2, f16 KV, ub=2048) measured pp32768 = 707.77 +- 9.94
in one job and 773.41 +- 2.87 in another, and tg128 = 27.16 vs 32.75. 1Cat's own
ledger notes the V100 clock falls from 1530 MHz to 1260-1275 MHz under sustained
load, which is the likely cause.

So: only within-job comparisons are trustworthy. Every headline number in this
archive is quoted from a single job that contains both sides of the comparison.
